Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:23:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: customize headunit framework behavior

    - core/res/res/values/config.xml: disable all transition animations via
      config_disableTransitionAnimation
    - packages/SettingsProvider/res/values/defaults.xml: set default window
      and transition animation scales to 0%
    - core/res/AndroidManifest.xml: allow privileged apps to hold
      MANAGE_ACTIVITY_TASKS
    - packages/SystemUI/navigationbar/NavigationBarInflaterView.java:
      regroup navbar into volume, navigation and shortcut clusters
    - services/java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java: install staged
      APKs from /system/preinstall before home starts, idempotent via
      /data/preinstall_done_* markers

Change-Id: I60dc974add44c9f6db4be87f354899068adc6a18
